surveillance."}, {"study_index": 19, "title": "Fluconazole prophylaxis in critically‐ill surgical patients: a           
meta‐analysis", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE To evaluate the impact of fluconazole prophylaxis on the incidence of fungal     
infections and on mortality among critically ill surgical patients. DESIGN Meta-analysis of randomized,                 
