  incidence of fungal infections in high-risk, critically ill surgical patients."}, {"study_index": 5, "title":         
  "Candida in the respiratory tract secretions of critically ill patients and the impact of antifungal treatment: a     
  randomized placebo controlled pilot trial (CANTREAT study)", "abstract": "PURPOSE Candida spp. are frequently         
  recovered from endotracheal secretions in critically ill patients suspected of having ventilator-associated           
