- Antifungal as part of broader decontamination regimen (Study 6)

This screening maintains conservative principles by including studies where there was uncertainty about meeting 
criteria, while clearly excluding those that definitively did not meet the RCT design requirement or the untargeted 
prophylaxis objective.
