- Study 8: Literature review on lung transplant antifungal prophylaxis - NOT AN RCT                                     
- Study 9: Case-control study validating prediction rules - NOT AN RCT                                                  
- Study 10: Cochrane review on neonatal antifungal prophylaxis - NOT AN RCT; wrong population                           
- Study 11: Prospective cohort study on Candida colonization - NOT AN RCT                                               
- Study 13: Prospective surveillance study on candidemia epidemiology - NOT AN RCT                                      
- Study 15: Cohort study developing MODS score - NOT AN RCT; NO ANTIFUNGAL INTERVENTION                                 
- Study 16: Consensus statement from expert panel - NOT AN RCT                                                          
