Review: Antifungal agents for preventing fungal infections in non‐neutropenic critically ill patients
Total studies to screen: 20

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included randomized controlled trials (RCTs) (irrespective of language or publication status) comparing the use of 
untargeted treatment with any antifungal drug (either systemic or nonabsorbable) to placebo, no antifungal, or another 
antifungal agent in non‐neutropenic critically ill participants.

