  respectively. The incidence of invasive fungal infection decreased significantly with administration of amphotericin  
  B (RR 0.41, 95% CI 0.24 to 0.73), fluconazole (RR 0.39, 95% CI 0.27 to 0.57) and itraconazole (RR 0.53, 95% CI 0.29   
