  antifungal therapy are warranted.   Trial registration ClinicalTrials.gov NCT00697944 PLOS"}, {"study_index": 55,     
  "title": "International Study of the Prevalence and Outcomes of Infection in Intensive Care Units", "abstract":       
  "CONTEXT Infection is a major cause of morbidity and mortality in intensive care units (ICUs) worldwide. However,     
  relatively little information is available about the global epidemiology of such infections. OBJECTIVE To provide an  
