│ infections are among the types of infection with the highest rates of inappropriate initial treatment. Because of    │
│ significant potential for reducing high mortality rates, we sought to assess the impact of delayed treatment across  │
│ multiple study sites. The goals our analyses were to establish the frequency and duration of delayed antifungal      │
