│ prospective, autopsy study", "abstract": "PURPOSE Recovery of Candida from the respiratory tract is common. Large    │
│ series on the incidence of histologically proven Candida pneumonia in intensive care unit (ICU) patients are         │
│ lacking. METHODS A two-year prospective study of all autopsies performed on patients who died in the ICU was         │
