│ patients", "abstract": "We conducted a prospective, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study to determine  │
│ whether or not ketoconazole could prevent yeast colonization or invasion in critically ill adult surgical patients.  │
│ Fifty-seven patients in a surgical intensive care unit (SICU) with three or more clinical risk factors for Candida   │
